#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "Reference za naredbe"

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "Opcije menija"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apart from the common &kde; menus described in the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/ui.html#menus\">Menu</ulink> chapter of the &kde; Fundamentals "
"documentation &kmplot; has these application specific menu entries:"
msgstr ""
"Osim zajedničkog &kde; menija opisanog u  <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui."
"html#menus\">Menu</ulink> poglavlje &kde; Fundamentals documentation "
"&kmplot; ima ove specifičke aplikacine menije:"

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The File Menu"
msgstr "Meni Direktorija"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izvoz...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Exports</action> the plotted graphs to an image file in all formats "
"supported by &kde;."
msgstr ""
"<action>Izvozi</action> iscrtane krafikona u sliku u svim formatima "
"podržanim u &kde;."

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit Menu"
msgstr "Meni Izmijeni"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Constants...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displays the <guilabel>Constants</guilabel> dialog box. See <xref linkend="
"\"constants-config\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Menu"
msgstr "Meni Pogled"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first three items in the menu are related to zooming."
msgstr "Prve tri stavke u meniju su namjenjena za uvećavanje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom In</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom In</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool can be operator in two different manners. To zoom in on a point on "
"the graph, click on it. To zoom in on a specific section of the graph, hold "
"and drag the mouse to form a rectangle, which will be the new axes ranges "
"when the mouse button is released."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom Out</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The tool can also be used in two different manners. To zoom out and center "
"on a point, click on that point. To fit the existing view into a rectangle, "
"hold and drag the mouse to form that rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj alat može takođe biti u dvije različite osobine. Za odzumiranje i "
"centrira, klik na centar. Da uklopite postojeci pogled u pragougaonik, "
"držite i povucite miša da napravite pravougaonik."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Fit Widget to Trigonometric Functions</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scale will be adapted to trigonometric functions. This works both for "
"radians and degrees."
msgstr ""
"Svaka će biti podešena za trigonometrijske funckije. Podržan rad za "
"raadijane i stepene."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Reset View</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resets the view."
msgstr "Resetira pogled."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Coordinate System...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displays the <guilabel>Coordinate System</guilabel> dialog box. See <xref "
"linkend=\"coords-config\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Sliders</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Toggles</action> the visibility of the slider dialog. In the dialog "
"move a slider to change the parameter of the function plot connected to it."
msgstr ""
"<action>Preklapa</action>vidljivost dijalog klizača.  U dijalogu pomaknete "
"klizač za promjenu parametra funkcije koji je priključen na njega."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this on the Function tab and select one of the sliders to change the "
"parameter value dynamically. The values vary from 0 (left) to 10 (right) by "
"default, but can be changed in the slider dialog."
msgstr ""
"Omogućite ovu na kartici Function tad i odaberite jednu od klizača da "
"dinamički promijenite vrijednost parametra. Vrijednosti variraju od 0 "
"(lijevo) do 10 (desno) po defaultu, ali se mogu promijeniti u dijalogu "
"klizača."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a small tutorial see <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/KmPlot/"
"Using_Sliders\">Using Sliders</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za kratki tutorijal pogledajte <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/KmPlot/"
"Using_Sliders\">Upotreba klizačas</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Tools Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "This menu contains some tools for the functions that can be useful:"
msgstr "Ovaj izbornik sadrži neke alate za funkcije koje mogu biti korisni:"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Calculator</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the <guilabel>Calculator</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr "Otvara <guilabel>Kalkulator</guilabel> dijalog."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Plot Area...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a graph and the values of the horizontal axis in the new dialog that "
"appears. Calculates the integral and draws the area between the graph and "
"the horizontal axis in the range of the selected values in the color of the "
"graph."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite graf i vrijednosti na horizontalnoj osi u novom dijalogu koji se "
"pojavi. Izračunava integraln i skreće između ploha  i horizontalnoj osi u "
"rasponu od odabrane vrijednosti u boji grafa."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find Minimum...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find the minimum value of the graph in a specified range."
msgstr "Pronalazi minimalnu vrijednost na grafu u zadanom opsegu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find Maximum...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find the maximum value of the graph in a specified range."
msgstr "Pronalazi maksimalnu vrijednost na grafu u zadanom opsegu."

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Help Menu"
msgstr "Meni pomoći"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmplot; has a standard &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> with one addition:"
msgstr "&kmplot; ima standardni &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> sa dodatkom:"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Predefined Math Functions...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens this handbook with a list of the predefined function names and "
"constants that &kmplot; knows."
msgstr ""
"Otvara priručnik sa listom predefinisanih funckija i konstanti koje &kmplot; "
"posjeduje."
